  "summary": "With 18 years of experience, I specialize in system analysis, design, and the development of web and enterprise applications using Java/J2EE technologies.\n\nTechnical Skills:\nLanguages : Core Java, J2EE, Python, HTML, CSS, Javascript\nAI/ML: Machine Learning, Deep Learning, NLP, Computer Vision, Model Deployment\nDatabase : SQL, PostgreSQL, NoSQL\nFrameworks / Protocols : Spring, SpringBoot, Spring Batch, Kafka, BlockChain, Hibernate, SAML2.0, OAuth2, OpenIDConnect, Digital Certificate, XMPP, Alfresco, Cordova, Ionic, Android, AngularJS, Bootstrap, JQuery, Atmosphere\nConcepts : Data structures and Algorithms patterns, Map Reduce\nServers : JBoss EAP/Fuse, Apache Tomcat, Openfire XMPP, Oracle Weblogic, OpenLDAP\nTechnologies : IBM Cloud, ELK Stack, Github/SVN, JMeter, RESTful Web Services, Swagger, Jenkins, WfmOpen, BPM\n\n\nCertifications and Awards:\nThe Post Graduate Program in Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning from the University of Texas at Austin\nAwarded multiple Delivery Excellence Awards for EdwardJones.\nAwarded with Technical Excellence Award for Unemployment Insurance Project for State of Wyoming.\nAwarded with Innovation Pride Award for Urjas project for Ministry of Petroleum.\nGoogle certified Associate Cloud Engineer.\nIBM certified cloud application developer.\nScaled Agile certified Leading SAFe.",
